00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.920
Now, let's get into this.
Day 14 - Capable and Equipped.&nbsp;

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:04.200
All scripture - not just some of it -&nbsp;
all scripture - is inspired by God and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.500
beneficial for teaching.
Listen carefully.&nbsp;

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:14.520
For rebuke - for correction - for&nbsp;
training in righteousness - so that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:22.200
the man or woman of God may be fully&nbsp;
capable, equipped for every good work.&nbsp;

