able to live as Godly men and Godly women.&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:41.220
It is the word of God which He&nbsp;
already chose to reveal to us.&nbsp;

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:49.620
The Logos and that's in 2 Timothy 3:16 to 17.
Now, we live in an amazing time.&nbsp;

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:56.580
We can access vast amounts of information with&nbsp;
just a few keystrokes and even now with AI,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:02.340
times are changing so fast.
