00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:32.040
And it's more important than ever to stick&nbsp;
to God's Word, to go back to the Bible.&nbsp;

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:36.660
And I want to say this to a lot of you&nbsp;
who are in churches and in ministries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:41.280
