is happening in the world.&nbsp;

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.620
What is now - in - what is modern&nbsp;
- plans - things to figure out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:51.180
systems - to work to to get more people in&nbsp;
the church and maybe you at home as well.&nbsp;

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.840
I need to try the the 10 steps to&nbsp;
