No you don't.
All you need to do is go back to God's Word.&nbsp;

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:09.480
Remember at the beginning of this Bible study,&nbsp;
2 Timothy 3:16 says all scripture is inspired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:14.100
by God and beneficial for teaching, for rebuke,&nbsp;
for correction, for training and righteousness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:22.500
so that the man or woman of God may be&nbsp;
fully capable, equipped for every good work.&nbsp;

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:30.120
God's Word is all you need.
The Logos and also together with the Rhema word&nbsp;&nbsp;

