00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:11.880
You're creating something that&nbsp;
is not real in your own head.&nbsp;

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:18.000
Fake religion.
So let's go back to God's Word and follow Him.&nbsp;

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:24.300
The second question here is - how might&nbsp;
God make you better equipped to serve Him?&nbsp;

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.980
Now, I'm just thinking here.
I wonder what many of you will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:31.800
answer to these two questions.
How about this?&nbsp;

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.320
How about you answer it and you&nbsp;
put it in the comment section?&nbsp;

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:42.420
Then we have a little bit of fellowship together.
Number one: Do you change the Bible to fit in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:47.160
with your lifestyle or do you change&nbsp;
your life to fit in with the Bible?&nbsp;

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:54.480
Number two: How might God make&nbsp;
you better equipped to serve Him?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:00.840
Add in the comment section, and then if you want&nbsp;
