00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:15.780
How to fight spiritual battles,&nbsp;
through the spirit and not the flesh.&nbsp;

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:23.040
What is the role of a husband in marriage?
How to come to the point of complete surrender.&nbsp;

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:28.080
And so much more.
Now, I just want to say it again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:33.480
to grow spiritually stronger as a man&nbsp;
you need to put God first in your life.&nbsp;

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:37.560
You need to study His Word.
Remember, the Word of God is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:41.400
sharper than a two-edged sword, cutting&nbsp;
to the vision between soul and spirit.&nbsp;

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:45.720
If you want to become spiritually stronger,&nbsp;
you need to understand God's Word.&nbsp;

