00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:45.840
But only one pursuit brings satisfaction on earth.
Because only one pursuit matters for eternity.&nbsp;

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:52.860
Becoming a true man of God.
The action-orientated teachings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:59.400
in Bold Pursuit will challenge and equip you to&nbsp;
pursue God above all else in your daily life.&nbsp;

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.960
I mean, what can be more important than that?
Nothing.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:11.760
As you dig deep into God's Word, you'll experience&nbsp;
the fulfillment of making your relationship with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:17.700
Jesus your greatest priority, through each day's&nbsp;
straightforward devotional reading packed with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.060
powerful biblical insights.
You'll explore how to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:26.040
worship God in spirit, and in truth.
What it means to engage in spiritual battle.&nbsp;

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.240
What sin - and isn't.
And why it matters.&nbsp;

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:37.380
Where to find hope when you're feeling hopeless.
Practical ways to overcome destructive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.920
habits and addictions.
And, how to make Bible study&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:46.860
and prayer an integrated part of your life.
Each daily reading in Bold Pursuit combines a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:53.280
Bible passage with a short devotional that speaks&nbsp;
to the real issues men face at work and home.&nbsp;

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:59.460
Prayer prompts, reflection questions,&nbsp;
and action items bring focus to each day.&nbsp;

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:06.240
And it was special for me to go through&nbsp;
one of these days together with you.&nbsp;

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:09.720
So you now know what to expect&nbsp;
with the other days as well.&nbsp;

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:15.720
In an age of distraction and busyness,&nbsp;
